  "faqQ1": "Why only 25 tasks a day?",
  "faqA1": "A fixed daily set keeps payouts predictable and sustainable for everyone. Premium members get 30/day, at the same ₹/task rate.",
  "faqQ2": "How much does each task pay?",
  "faqA2": "₹100 per task — complete all 25 and earn up to ₹2,500 a day.",
  "faqQ3": "When do my daily tasks reset?",
  "faqA3": "At midnight, every day. Whatever's left of today's cap disappears — there's no rollover.",
  "faqQ4": "Why can't I skip the ad?",
  "faqA4": "Your reward is funded by the advertiser paying for a full view — skipping early means no reward can be credited. Credit only fires once the ad finishes playing to the end, not on tap or open.",
  "faqQ5": "Can I get more tasks by using multiple accounts?",
  "faqA5": "No — each phone number gets one account, and using multiple accounts is against our terms.",

  "faqQ6": "When do I get paid?",
  "faqA6": "Withdrawals are processed once a month, on the 1st, straight to your UPI ID or a verified bank account (IMPS transfer).",
  "faqQ7": "Can I withdraw whenever I want?",
  "faqA7": "Not right now — payouts are monthly only, there's no on-demand withdrawal.",
  "faqQ8": "Which payment methods do you support?",
  "faqA8": "UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm) and verified bank account transfer only — no PayPal, no wallets, no other payout methods.",
  "faqQ9": "What if I have the wrong UPI ID saved?",
  "faqA9": "Payouts go to whatever's saved in Settings, so double-check it before the 1st — a typo means a delayed payout while our team helps you fix it.",

  "faqQ10": "How much do I earn per referral?",
  "faqA10": "₹125 flat, credited only when the person you referred completes the ₹49 Premium purchase — never for signing up alone.",
  "faqQ11": "Why is my referral still showing as \"pending\"?",
  "faqA11": "It stays pending until your referral's Premium payment clears. Once it does, the ₹125 credits automatically.",
  "faqQ12": "What does Premium include?",
  "faqA12": "30 tasks/day instead of 25, at the same ₹/task rate — never a smaller cut per task.",
  "faqQ13": "Can I cancel Premium anytime?",
  "faqA13": "Yes, from Profile → Manage subscription. Your benefits continue until the end of the paid cycle, even after you cancel.",
  "faqQ14": "What happens if my referral's Premium purchase is refunded?",
  "faqA14": "The ₹125 commission is reversed — deducted from your balance, even from a future payout if it's already been paid out.",
  "faqQ15": "What is the weekly referral bonus?",
  "faqA15": "Premium members who get 5 or more referrals converting to Premium within the same Sunday–Saturday week earn +5 bonus ad slots, active the following week. It's gated on you holding Premium yourself. Free-tier accounts still earn the ₹125 commission, just never this bonus.",
  "faqQ16": "Does it matter when my referral signed up, or when they went Premium?",
  "faqA16": "Only the week their Premium purchase lands counts toward your 5. Signup timing doesn't matter, and each week is judged on its own. If 4 convert one week and a 5th converts the next, neither week reaches 5 and no bonus fires for either.",

